   "kind": "dark",
   "title": "Bleeding in early pregnancy: is it IN the uterus, and is it VIABLE?",
   "lines": [
    "every one: vitals · complete blood count · group and screen · quantitative beta-hCG (β-hCG) · transvaginal ultrasound",
    "Rh NEGATIVE + bleeding → Rh immunoglobulin · send any tissue passed to pathology"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_sa",
   "x": 45,
   "y": 138,
   "w": 666,
   "h": 78,
   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "Pregnancy IN the uterus: MISCARRIAGE",
   "lines": [
    "the CERVIX (open or closed) and the FETAL HEART decide the type"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "g_gtd",
   "x": 751,
